  "id": "wet-nurse",
  "term": "wet nurse",
  "definition": "A wet nurse is a woman who breastfeeds and nourishes an infant who is not her own. In this historical passage, the term is used as an alternative source of feeding for a child when the mother is not considered fit to suckle it.",
